# Guarantee LF in the repository regardless of each contributor's core.autocrlf
# setting, so a Windows and a Linux contributor cannot produce whole-file diffs
# from line endings alone.
#
# Deliberately no `eol=` here: that would also force the *working tree* to LF and
# rewrite every checked-out file on Windows for no benefit. Checkout stays
# per-platform; only the stored form is pinned.
* text=auto

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
